      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp Hub · Inbox API\nWhat the WhatsApp Inbox app on the laptop talks to. Every call needs the `X-Inbox-Key` header (n8n credential *Inbox Key*). Only Azolute's own number.\n\n- `GET /webhook/wa-inbox/messages?since=<ms>&limit=<≤1000>` → `{rows, next}`\n- `POST /webhook/wa-inbox/send` `{to, text}` → `{ok, row}` or `{ok:false, error}`\n- `GET /webhook/wa-inbox/media?id=<media id>` → the file\n- `POST /webhook/wa-inbox/import` `{rows}` → `{ok, received}` (old Twilio chats; safe to repeat)\n\nSuccessful runs are not saved (the inbox polls every few seconds).",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 160,
        "height": 224
      }
    }
